# ADK engineering team - environment template
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Copy this file to '.env' in this directory:   cp .env.example .env
# 2. Uncomment and fill in the values you need.
# 3. NEVER commit your real '.env' file or any real key to Git.
#
# Nothing here is needed for the offline mock run: without GOOGLE_API_KEY,
# `python main.py` uses a scripted mock model. Pass --real to force live calls.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Gemini (Google AI Studio) -----------------------------------------------
# Left commented on purpose: any non-empty value switches runs to live Gemini.
# GOOGLE_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here

# --- Model per agent (optional, default gemini-3.8-flash) --------------------
# ARCHITECT_MODEL=gemini-3.8-flash
# JUNIOR_MODEL=gemini-3.8-flash
# SENIOR_MODEL=gemini-3.8-flash

# --- Paths (optional) --------------------------------------------------------
# TEAM_WORKSPACE=workspace                      Where agents' files are written
# COE_TOOL_PATH=../../tools/context-orchestration-engine
#                                               Location of the engine (default: this repo)
